630
01:15:32.290 --> 01:15:34.290
By whom was it written?

631
01:15:34.290 --> 01:15:36.290
In what year was it approximately written?

632
01:15:36.290 --> 01:15:42.290
And also genre, because then you come to the question of why.

633
01:15:42.290 --> 01:15:44.290
Why was this written? What is its purpose?

634
01:15:44.290 --> 01:15:46.290
And what can I do with it?

635
01:15:46.290 --> 01:15:53.290
And what we often say is that

636
01:15:53.290 --> 01:15:56.290
there are so many wonderful things in the Bible

637
01:15:56.290 --> 01:15:59.290
that have such an enormous deep meaning

638
01:15:59.290 --> 01:16:03.290
