639
01:16:03.290 --> 01:16:10.290
Acts is probably the book that most resembles how we

640
01:16:10.290 --> 01:16:14.290
modern people would write a piece.

641
01:16:14.290 --> 01:16:17.290
Acts was written by Luke

642
01:16:17.290 --> 01:16:20.290
and Luke was a doctor.

643
01:16:20.290 --> 01:16:25.290
A doctor, but not just any kind of doctor,

644
01:16:25.290 --> 01:16:32.290
but Luke was probably a Greek slave

645
01:16:32.290 --> 01:16:35.290
and by a slave I mean that

646
01:16:35.290 --> 01:16:39.290
imagine you are here in the audience and you have a master's degree

647
01:16:39.290 --> 01:16:42.290
and you want to become a doctor and your name is Sammy.

648
01:16:42.290 --> 01:16:48.290
Imagine you are studying hard to become a doctor

649
01:16:48.290 --> 01:16:52.290
then you position yourself in society

650
01:16:52.290 --> 01:16:55.290
as someone who has a diploma

651
01:16:55.290 --> 01:16:58.290
and who can help the people

652
01:16:58.290 --> 01:17:02.290
and thereby also, of course, have a stable and good income.

653
01:17:02.290 --> 01:17:04.290
But you do this for yourself in complete freedom

654
01:17:04.290 --> 01:17:08.290
because we live in a free society. Amen?

655
01:17:08.290 --> 01:17:12.290
Luke was probably in that time it was such

656
01:17:12.290 --> 01:17:14.290
that if you were a doctor

657
01:17:14.290 --> 01:17:17.290
then someone had to pay for a very expensive education

658
01:17:17.290 --> 01:17:19.290
and the one who pays is the owner.

659
01:17:19.290 --> 01:17:23.290
And so in that way when you see the word slave in the Bible

660
01:17:23.290 --> 01:17:26.290
we think of slavery and we think of difficulty, hardship

661
01:17:26.290 --> 01:17:29.290
that's right, it's not good, everyone should be free

662
01:17:29.290 --> 01:17:33.290
but slavery can also mean having a good position

663
01:17:33.290 --> 01:17:34.290
or having a good job.

664
01:17:34.290 --> 01:17:38.290
And Luke was probably someone with a very high education

665
01:17:38.290 --> 01:17:40.290
in the possession of someone else

666
01:17:40.290 --> 01:17:43.290
so that he could do his work on behalf of.

