01:17:43.290 --> 01:17:45.290
Do you understand what I mean?

668
01:17:45.290 --> 01:17:51.290
And what Luke did is he wrote an account of the life of Jesus

669
01:17:51.290 --> 01:17:58.290
and this is the genre, narrative, this is the genre that Luke used

670
01:17:58.290 --> 01:18:01.290
to write a good, as good as possible account

671
01:18:01.290 --> 01:18:05.290
just like a journalist writing about the things of Jesus

672
01:18:05.290 --> 01:18:07.290
to prove who Jesus was.

673
01:18:07.290 --> 01:18:10.290
And so when we read Acts

674
01:18:10.290 --> 01:18:13.290
we actually see before us, before our eyes

675
01:18:13.290 --> 01:18:16.290
that this is actually a kind of text

676
01:18:16.290 --> 01:18:19.290
that comes across to us as very narrative and accurate.

