01:18:30.290 --> 01:18:32.290
you brought your Bible, yes.

681
01:18:32.290 --> 01:18:35.290
So now we are going to the book of Acts

682
01:18:35.290 --> 01:18:41.290
and then you see the first word is that he addresses Theophilus

683
01:18:41.290 --> 01:18:46.290
and Theophilus means theos, philos

684
01:18:46.290 --> 01:18:52.290
so Theophilus, that means God, loving.

685
01:18:52.290 --> 01:18:57.290
So either there was a man named Theophilus

686
01:18:57.290 --> 01:19:01.290
or we are looking at a group of people that he addresses

687
01:19:01.290 --> 01:19:04.290
and another study says

688
01:19:04.290 --> 01:19:09.290
that Luke wrote a report at the request of Theophilus

689
01:19:09.290 --> 01:19:13.290
to actually prove the work of Paul.

690
01:19:13.290 --> 01:19:16.290
That is another piece I read recently.

691
01:19:16.290 --> 01:19:22.290
