Yes but, if Peter says brothers and sisters in verse 16.

1369
02:00:07.290 --> 02:00:09.290
Can we look at verse 16?

1370
02:00:09.290 --> 02:00:11.290
Brothers and sisters.

1371
02:00:11.290 --> 02:00:13.290
In the books.

1372
02:00:13.290 --> 02:00:17.290
David has already spoken about Judas through the Holy Spirit.

1373
02:00:17.290 --> 02:00:20.290
In other words, it was already determined that Judas was going to do it.

1374
02:00:20.290 --> 02:00:22.290
And then people ask the question.

1375
02:00:22.290 --> 02:00:24.290
About Calvinism.

1376
02:00:24.290 --> 02:00:26.290
Read a book about it if you like.

1377
02:00:26.290 --> 02:00:29.290
And then people ask the question.

1378
02:00:29.290 --> 02:00:31.290
Yes but, if it was already determined.

1379
02:00:31.290 --> 02:00:33.290
Could he do anything about it?

1380
02:00:33.290 --> 02:00:35.290
Of course.

1381
02:00:35.290 --> 02:00:37.290
It is your choice.

1382
02:00:37.290 --> 02:00:39.290
Yes, but if everything is predetermined.

1383
02:00:39.290 --> 02:00:41.290
Then I have no room for maneuver.

1384
02:00:41.290 --> 02:00:43.290
Then I cannot choose.

1385
02:00:43.290 --> 02:00:45.290
Yes, but listen carefully.

1386
02:00:45.290 --> 02:00:48.290
If God is indeed powerful.

1387
02:00:48.290 --> 02:00:50.290
God has all power.

1388
02:00:50.290 --> 02:00:52.290
All strength.

1389
02:00:52.290 --> 02:00:54.290
God has all wisdom.

1390
02:00:54.290 --> 02:00:56.290
And God is always.

1391
02:00:56.290 --> 02:00:58.290
He is everywhere.

1392
02:00:58.290 --> 02:01:01.290
So we must go from today.

1393
02:01:01.290 --> 02:01:03.290
Towards tomorrow.

1394
02:01:03.290 --> 02:01:05.290
God is already tomorrow.

1395
02:01:06.290 --> 02:01:08.290
God is already at the end.

1396
02:01:08.290 --> 02:01:11.290
He is the alpha and the omega.

1397
02:01:11.290 --> 02:01:13.290
He is the beginning and the end.

1398
02:01:13.290 --> 02:01:16.290
God does not go from the beginning to the end.

1399
02:01:16.290 --> 02:01:18.290
The dumbest question about God is.

1400
