Who made God then?

1402
02:01:22.290 --> 02:01:24.290
He is Creator.

1403
02:01:24.290 --> 02:01:26.290
He is not creation.

1404
02:01:26.290 --> 02:01:28.290
So God is Creator.

1405
02:01:28.290 --> 02:01:30.290
He made time.

1406
02:01:30.290 --> 02:01:32.290
He is not part of time.

1407
02:01:32.290 --> 02:01:34.290
He stands above time.

1408
02:01:34.290 --> 02:01:36.290
So if God makes me at the beginning of time.

1409
02:01:36.290 --> 02:01:38.290
And then I am eventually born.

1410
02:01:38.290 --> 02:01:40.290
In His time.

1411
02:01:40.290 --> 02:01:42.290
Not in my time.

1412
02:01:43.290 --> 02:01:46.290
And then He sees the choices I make.

1413
02:01:46.290 --> 02:01:49.290
He sees the choices I make.

1414
02:01:49.290 --> 02:01:51.290
For He is always and all-knowing.

1415
02:01:51.290 --> 02:01:53.290
He sees it happen.

1416
02:01:53.290 --> 02:01:55.290
He was at my birth.

1417
02:01:55.290 --> 02:01:57.290
He is with me.

1418
02:01:57.290 --> 02:01:59.290
Seeing the Lord.

1419
02:01:59.290 --> 02:02:01.290
That is seamless.

1420
02:02:01.290 --> 02:02:03.290
I will not die.

1421
02:02:03.290 --> 02:02:06.290
I want to be taken up by a chariot of fire.

1422
02:02:06.290 --> 02:02:08.290
Just like Elijah.

1423
02:02:08.290 --> 02:02:10.290
I think that would be really cool.

1424
02:02:13.290 --> 02:02:15.290
Back to the subject.

1425
02:02:15.290 --> 02:02:17.290
So when God sees.

1426
02:02:17.290 --> 02:02:20.290
The choice that I ultimately make.

1427
02:02:20.290 --> 02:02:23.290
My choice to belong to Him.

1428
02:02:23.290 --> 02:02:25.290
I want to belong to Him.

1429
02:02:25.290 --> 02:02:29.290
Based on the choices He allows me to make.

1430
02:02:29.290 --> 02:02:30.290
My responsibility.

1431
02:02:30.290 --> 02:02:32.290
My choice.

1432
02:02:32.290 --> 02:02:34.290
That is why God gives me all grace.

1433
02:02:34.290 --> 02:02:36.290
And patience.

1434
02:02:36.290 --> 02:02:38.290
And equipping.

1435
02:02:38.290 --> 02:02:40.290
To belong to Him.

1436
02:02:40.290 --> 02:02:42.290
And that is why it is certain.

1437
02:02:42.290 --> 02:02:44.290
For He says.

1438
