1442
02:02:52.290 --> 02:02:54.290
His choice.

1443
02:02:54.290 --> 02:02:56.290
And those mistakes will bring him a lot of misery.

1444
02:02:56.290 --> 02:02:58.290
But it is certain.

1445
02:02:58.290 --> 02:03:00.290
Because he is already there.

1446
02:03:00.290 --> 02:03:02.290
Do you all understand this?

1447
02:03:02.290 --> 02:03:04.290
So what is written here.

1448
02:03:04.290 --> 02:03:06.290
That is already in the books.

1449
