Doesn't mean that Judas had no free will.

1455
02:03:29.290 --> 02:03:30.290
We have the choice.

1456
02:03:30.290 --> 02:03:32.290
The choice is up to us.

1457
02:03:32.290 --> 02:03:34.290
The choice is up to me.

1458
02:03:34.290 --> 02:03:36.290
I have day in and day out.

1459
02:03:36.290 --> 02:03:38.290
The choice to belong to Jesus.

1460
02:03:38.290 --> 02:03:40.290
I have day in and day out.

1461
02:03:40.290 --> 02:03:42.290
Even when I feel down.

1462
02:03:42.290 --> 02:03:44.290
Even when I think.

1463
02:03:44.290 --> 02:03:46.290
I just don't feel like reading the Bible today.

1464
02:03:46.290 --> 02:03:48.290
Do you know what I need to say then?

1465
02:03:48.290 --> 02:03:50.290
No, Tim.

1466
02:03:50.290 --> 02:03:52.290
No, soul.

1467
02:03:52.290 --> 02:03:54.290
Lift yourself up.

1468
02:03:54.290 --> 02:03:56.290
Get out of that bed.

1469
02:03:56.290 --> 02:03:58.290
Go to your Bible.

1470
02:03:58.290 --> 02:04:00.290
And worship Him every day again.

1471
02:04:00.290 --> 02:04:02.290
For whatever is certain about me.

1472
02:04:02.290 --> 02:04:04.290
On my side of the coin, I say.

1473
02:04:04.290 --> 02:04:06.290
I and my house.

1474
02:04:06.290 --> 02:04:08.290
We will serve the Lord.

1475
02:04:35.290 --> 02:04:37.290
This is what happens.

1476
02:04:37.290 --> 02:04:39.290
I think this piece is also spiritual talk.

1477
02:04:39.290 --> 02:04:41.290
This is what happens when you leave Jesus.

1478
02:04:42.290 --> 02:04:44.290
Everyone in Jerusalem has heard of it.

1479
02:04:44.290 --> 02:04:46.290
That's why they call that piece of land.

1480
02:04:46.290 --> 02:04:48.290
Akeldama.

1481
02:04:48.290 --> 02:04:50.290
That means blood ground.

1482
02:04:50.290 --> 02:04:52.290
The book of Psalms speaks about this.

1483
02:04:52.290 --> 02:04:54.290
Let the place where he lived become desolate.

1484
02:04:54.290 --> 02:04:56.290
Let no one go and live there.

1485
02:04:56.290 --> 02:04:58.290
When you turn away from God.

1486
02:04:58.290 --> 02:05:00.290
Your life becomes desolate.

1487
02:05:00.290 --> 02:05:02.290
When you turn away from God.

1488
02:05:02.290 --> 02:05:04.290
Especially if you have known him.

1489
