Especially if you have ever truly believed that he is here.

1492
02:05:13.290 --> 02:05:15.290
There is no second crucifixion.

1493
02:05:16.290 --> 02:05:18.290
The Bible says in the letter to the Hebrews.

1494
02:05:18.290 --> 02:05:21.290
If you have ever been in this hall.

1495
02:05:21.290 --> 02:05:23.290
That is really crazy.

1496
02:05:23.290 --> 02:05:25.290
That is really super crazy.

1497
