And then say goodbye to God.

1499
02:05:33.290 --> 02:05:35.290
It cannot be made right anymore.

1500
02:05:35.290 --> 02:05:37.290
Then your life becomes desolate.

1501
02:05:37.290 --> 02:05:39.290
Is everything going to ruin?

1502
02:05:39.290 --> 02:05:41.290
Is everything falling apart.

1503
