That Jesus has risen from the dead.

1522
02:06:23.290 --> 02:06:28.290
It must be someone who was already with us when the Lord Jesus was still with us.

1523
02:06:28.290 --> 02:06:30.290
He must have gone along with us already.

1524
02:06:30.290 --> 02:06:32.290
These are the definitions of a true apostle.

1525
02:06:32.290 --> 02:06:35.290
He must have gone along with us already.

1526
02:06:35.290 --> 02:06:38.290
From the day that Jesus was baptized by John.

1527
02:06:38.290 --> 02:06:40.290
Until the day that Jesus went to heaven.

1528
02:06:40.290 --> 02:06:43.290
These are the requirements to be an apostle.

1529
02:06:44.290 --> 02:06:45.290
They proposed two men.

1530
02:06:45.290 --> 02:06:49.290
Joseph, called Bar Sabbas, who was also known as Justice.

1531
02:06:49.290 --> 02:06:50.290
And Matthias.

1532
02:06:50.290 --> 02:06:51.290
They prayed.

1533
02:06:51.290 --> 02:06:53.290
Lord, you know all hearts.

1534
02:06:53.290 --> 02:06:56.290
Will you indicate which of these two you have chosen?

1535
02:06:56.290 --> 02:07:01.290
Then he will take Judas' place and assume his task.

1536
02:07:01.290 --> 02:07:04.290
For Judas is no longer here.

1537
02:07:04.290 --> 02:07:05.290
Intense.

1538
02:07:06.290 --> 02:07:08.290
He has gone to the place where he belongs.

1539
02:07:09.290 --> 02:07:14.290
They had the men cast lots, and so Matthias was chosen.

1540
02:07:14.290 --> 02:07:17.290
From that moment on, he was one of the eleven apostles.

1541
02:07:20.290 --> 02:07:22.290
From that moment on, he belonged to the eleven apostles.

1542
02:07:22.290 --> 02:07:24.290
There were twelve disciples.

1543
02:07:25.290 --> 02:07:27.290
And Judas falls away.

1544
02:07:28.290 --> 02:07:29.290
What does that matter?

1545
02:07:29.290 --> 02:07:30.290
Then you just continue with eleven, right?

1546
02:07:30.290 --> 02:07:32.290
But then a twelfth had to come.

1547
02:07:32.290 --> 02:07:37.290
As soon as I say the number three to you, we know resurrection.

1548
02:07:37.290 --> 02:07:40.290
As soon as I say the number seven to you, we know completeness.

1549
02:07:40.290 --> 02:07:42.290
Creation, completeness.

1550
02:07:42.290 --> 02:07:47.290
As soon as I say the number twelve to you, everyone says Israel.

1551
02:07:47.290 --> 02:07:48.290
Everyone then says Israel.

1552
02:07:48.290 --> 02:07:52.290
Why did that twelfth need to be added?

1553
02:07:52.290 --> 02:07:54.290
Eleven is also a fine number, isn't it? It's enough, right?

1554
02:07:54.290 --> 02:07:59.290
The twelfth had to be added because God's kingdom and His plan had to continue.

1555
02:08:01.290 --> 02:08:08.290
Sometimes I receive a message because the coach of Joshua's group...

1556
02:08:08.290 --> 02:08:12.290
In another group, they need an extra player for a certain match,

1557
02:08:12.290 --> 02:08:14.290
because too many children are sick, for example.

1558
02:08:14.290 --> 02:08:16.290
And then they say, we need eight.

1559
02:08:16.290 --> 02:08:18.290
At this moment, we only have eight.

1560
02:08:18.290 --> 02:08:21.290
Or, that's not enough, so add one or two or three more.

1561
02:08:21.290 --> 02:08:22.290
Just do whatever.

1562
02:08:22.290 --> 02:08:26.290
And then one or two or three children will sign up and then we have a nice competition.

1563
02:08:26.290 --> 02:08:29.290
This is not the case with the apostles, of just look.

1564
02:08:29.290 --> 02:08:31.290
Eleven is fine too.

1565
02:08:31.290 --> 02:08:33.290
No, this is not. This is twelve.

1566
02:08:33.290 --> 02:08:37.290
Twelve is Israel. The twelve tribes of Israel.

1567
02:08:37.290 --> 02:08:41.290
And God's kingdom is important for God's kingdom.

1568
02:08:41.290 --> 02:08:44.290
He wants it to be fulfilled in His way.

1569
02:08:44.290 --> 02:08:46.290
Not in our way.

1570
02:08:46.290 --> 02:08:49.290
Yes, Judas fell away, figure it out. It will be fine.

1571
02:08:49.290 --> 02:08:51.290
Eleven, we will continue with eleven.

1572
02:08:51.290 --> 02:08:55.290
No, eleven is not good. If God says twelve, then it is twelve.

1573
02:08:55.290 --> 02:08:59.290
Yes, but we can also include those two men.

1574
02:08:59.290 --> 02:09:02.290
Joseph and Justus. Then we have thirteen.

1575
02:09:02.290 --> 02:09:04.290
That is an even better team.

1576
02:09:04.290 --> 02:09:08.290
No, says God. If I say twelve, then it is twelve.

1577
02:09:08.290 --> 02:09:11.290
Do you understand what I am talking about?

1578
02:09:11.290 --> 02:09:13.290
It is not what we make of it.

1579
02:09:13.290 --> 02:09:15.290
It is not how we handle our lives.

1580
02:09:15.290 --> 02:09:20.290
It is not how we fill in God's kingdom and our task in it.

1581
02:09:20.290 --> 02:09:22.290
It is about what God has for us.

1582
02:09:22.290 --> 02:09:25.290
May I pray for you? Shall we stand?

1583
02:09:27.290 --> 02:09:30.290
I want to pray for two important matters.

1584
02:09:30.290 --> 02:09:33.290
Unless you really need to go to the bar or do something,

1585
02:09:33.290 --> 02:09:36.290
I would like to ask if people could please not leave the room

1586
02:09:36.290 --> 02:09:38.290
before the service is truly over.

1587
02:09:39.290 --> 02:09:42.290
I would like to pray for two things.

1588
02:09:42.290 --> 02:09:46.290
Namely one, for your soul.

1589
02:09:46.290 --> 02:09:48.290
I really want to pray for your soul.

1590
02:09:48.290 --> 02:09:53.290
And you need to produce an amen in your soul.

1591
02:09:53.290 --> 02:09:57.290
Otherwise, I can pray for your soul, but it is your choice.

1592
02:09:57.290 --> 02:10:01.290
And two, that God's will be done in our lives.

1593
02:10:01.290 --> 02:10:03.290
So can we close our eyes?

1594
02:10:03.290 --> 02:10:07.290
Dear Father in heaven, I thank you for all the people in this room.

1595
02:10:07.290 --> 02:10:12.290
Lord, I thank you for your love, for your goodness, your grace.

1596
02:10:12.290 --> 02:10:16.290
I thank you, Jesus, for the risen Lord Jesus Christ.

1597
02:10:16.290 --> 02:10:22.290
I thank you that He has risen, so that in Christ we can live

1598
02:10:22.290 --> 02:10:25.290
and we can be part of God's kingdom.

1599
02:10:25.290 --> 02:10:28.290
Lord, I want to pray for all the people in this room

1600
02:10:28.290 --> 02:10:31.290
that we will stay close to Jesus.

1601
02:10:31.290 --> 02:10:34.290
That we will stay close to Jesus.

1602
02:10:34.290 --> 02:10:38.290
I pronounce this blessing over everyone in this room.

1603
02:10:38.290 --> 02:10:42.290
Whether you have known Jesus for a long time, or you don't really know Him at all.

1604
02:10:42.290 --> 02:10:47.290
I pray for you, in the name of Jesus, that you will be with Him.

1605
02:10:47.290 --> 02:10:52.290
That you will not live according to the nonsense of this world or for yourself,

1606
02:10:52.290 --> 02:10:54.290
but that you will be with Jesus.

1607
02:10:54.290 --> 02:10:57.290
That we will take this seriously in the name of Jesus.

1608
02:10:57.290 --> 02:10:59.290
That we will be with Him.

1609
02:10:59.290 --> 02:11:01.290
That we will not just be in the church,

1610
02:11:01.290 --> 02:11:03.290
that we will not just be present,

1611
02:11:03.290 --> 02:11:05.290
but that we will be in Christ.

1612
02:11:05.290 --> 02:11:08.290
That we will be filled with the Holy Spirit.

1613
02:11:08.290 --> 02:11:11.290
That we will return every day.

1614
02:11:11.290 --> 02:11:14.290
As long as the call of the Holy Spirit says

1615
02:11:14.290 --> 02:11:16.290
fill in your own name, but that it is for me

1616
02:11:16.290 --> 02:11:18.290
Tim, come back to me.

1617
02:11:18.290 --> 02:11:20.290
Tim, do not leave your Bible for a day.

1618
02:11:20.290 --> 02:11:22.290
Tim, pray to me.

1619
02:11:22.290 --> 02:11:23.290
Tim, come to me.

1620
02:11:23.290 --> 02:11:25.290
Tim, go here and do not go there.

1621
02:11:25.290 --> 02:11:30.290
Let the voice of the Holy Spirit be loud in your soul.

1622
02:11:30.290 --> 02:11:36.290
So that you will not, like Judas, have a breeding ground for bad seed.

1623
02:11:36.290 --> 02:11:40.290
Lord, I want to pray for everyone in Open Church

1624
02:11:40.290 --> 02:11:43.290
who has given space to bad seed,

1625
02:11:43.290 --> 02:11:45.290
which has ultimately become a root.

1626
02:11:45.290 --> 02:11:47.290
A root of uncleanness has become.

1627
02:11:47.290 --> 02:11:49.290
A root of corruption has become.

1628
02:11:49.290 --> 02:11:51.290
A root of discord.

1629
02:11:51.290 --> 02:11:54.290
A root of unforgiveness.

1630
02:11:54.290 --> 02:11:57.290
A root of a careless life.

1631
02:11:57.290 --> 02:11:59.290
A root of lukewarmness.

1632
02:11:59.290 --> 02:12:01.290
A root of distance from God.

1633
02:12:01.290 --> 02:12:06.290
Lord, I want to pray that through the Holy Spirit and through the blood of Jesus

1634
02:12:06.290 --> 02:12:09.290
the bitter root will be removed.

1635
02:12:09.290 --> 02:12:13.290
Lord, so that we will be purer, will be with Jesus.

1636
02:12:14.290 --> 02:12:18.290
And Lord, I also want to pray in Jesus' name that everyone in this room

1637
02:12:18.290 --> 02:12:22.290
will realize that God has a place

1638
02:12:22.290 --> 02:12:24.290
in the kingdom of God.

1639
02:12:24.290 --> 02:12:26.290
He has a place for you

1640
02:12:26.290 --> 02:12:28.290
in the kingdom of God.

1641
02:12:28.290 --> 02:12:31.290
He not only has a place

1642
02:12:31.290 --> 02:12:34.290
for that person you know in your family who is so faithful.

1643
02:12:34.290 --> 02:12:36.290
He has a place for you

1644
02:12:36.290 --> 02:12:38.290
in the kingdom of God.

1645
02:12:38.290 --> 02:12:40.290
Not only to be saved,

1646
02:12:40.290 --> 02:12:43.290
but with a task for you in His kingdom.

1647
02:12:43.290 --> 02:12:47.290
While all eyes are still closed for ten seconds.

1648
02:12:47.290 --> 02:12:50.290
I want to bless you in the name of Jesus

1649
02:12:50.290 --> 02:12:53.290
that through the Holy Spirit you will come to realize

1650
02:12:53.290 --> 02:12:56.290
what your task is in the kingdom of God.

1651
02:12:56.290 --> 02:12:59.290
Let the Holy Spirit speak to you.

1652
02:12:59.290 --> 02:13:01.290
For those people who sometimes struggle with that.

1653
02:13:01.290 --> 02:13:03.290
Yes, but Tim, what is my task in God's kingdom?

1654
02:13:03.290 --> 02:13:06.290
I bless you in Jesus' name

1655
02:13:06.290 --> 02:13:09.290
that the Holy Spirit can speak to your soul.

1656
02:13:09.290 --> 02:13:11.290
That there is a pure and open heart

1657
02:13:11.290 --> 02:13:14.290
receptive to the voice of the Holy Spirit.

1658
02:13:14.290 --> 02:13:16.290
And that He will tell you

1659
02:13:16.290 --> 02:13:19.290
this and this is the task I have for you.

1660
02:13:19.290 --> 02:13:22.290
And that you will be obedient to it.

1661
02:13:22.290 --> 02:13:24.290
In Jesus' mighty name.

1662
02:13:24.290 --> 02:13:28.290
And we all say amen. Amen. Hallelujah.

1663
02:13:31.290 --> 02:13:36.290
Dear people, happy Sunday. Next week baby blessing service.

1664
02:13:36.290 --> 02:13:40.290
If you want to have your baby dedicated in the name of Jesus

1665
02:13:40.290 --> 02:13:43.290
please let us know in the Open Church app.

1666
02:13:43.290 --> 02:13:46.290
Happy Sunday. We love you. Bye bye.

1667
02:13:49.290 --> 02:13:52.290
Subtitles submitted by the Amara.org community
